    "updated_at": "2019-09-03T14:47:43Z",
    "body": "> One question though: should we have the user activation restriction even for hiding the keyboard (e.g. when changing `inputmode=text` to `inputmode=none`?\r\n\r\nFWIW, Safari on iOS doesn’t have a user gesture restriction for _blurring_ the focused element. We also allow `inputmode` to change dynamically (even without user gesture) if the element was already focused by the user, so this should be okay.",
