    "updated_at": "2019-09-06T20:46:59Z",
    "body": "Updating the spec to clarify the existing behavior as described in the first bullet point makes sense to me.\r\n\r\nFor the second bullet point, we'd have to examine if such an API would allow new kinds of API abuse but my first impression of it is that it's probably okay.\r\n\r\nNeedless to say, we should do that in two separate PRs. I guess we might want to file a new issue for the second point so that we can split the discussion, and use this issue to continue to focus on the first point.",
