    "updated_at": "2019-11-07T17:27:50Z",
    "body": "That seems reasonable to me. The proposal in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/4876#issuecomment-529003304 notes how those are the two underlying pieces of state, and proposed a way to use a single API (inputmode) to cover them. But perhaps it's more straightforward to just expose two APIs.",
