    "created_at": "2020-05-21T21:03:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-05-21T21:03:07Z",
    "body": "There is already consensus above that clarifying the current spec as per the first bullet [here](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/4876#issuecomment-529003304) is the correct thing to do.  Let's focus this issue on that discussion only (and not on changing any current behavior).\r\n\r\n@domenic: please consider \"renaming\" this issue to avoid re-conflating the two directions.\r\n\r\nFor any discussion on how we can improve or preserve `inputmode=none` behavior, the VirtualKeyboardAPI [issue](https://github.com/w3ctag/design-reviews/issues/498) mentioned above is the right place, where the proposed `virtualkeyboardpolicy=auto` seems to cover the legacy behavior IIUC.",
